celld-ml is an OCaml reimplementation of the architecture of celld
(https://github.com/denoland/celld), Copyright 2026 Deno Land Inc.,
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. lib/ltx follows celld's LTX
format and crates/ltx and was rewritten in OCaml; the protocols in
lib/logic, lib/wire and unikernels/node follow celld's design. These are
modified works: none of celld's source is included verbatim.

lib/sqlite/sqlite3.c and sqlite3.h are the SQLite 3.54.1 amalgamation
(https://sqlite.org), which is in the public domain.
